  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Institutional Capacity of the Procuradoria Especial da Mulher</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot; Strengthening the institutional capacity of the Procuradoria Especial da Mulher Development objectives: The development objective of the proposed grant is to strengthen the institutional capacity of Procuardoria Especial da mulher &quot;&quot;Procuradoria&quot;&quot; to promote and monitor legislation addressing gender equality in Brazil. This would consist of the following components: Developing a Strategic Action Plan for the Procuradoria; Database to monitor legislation on gender issues to inform the decision making process on gender equality legislation; Expanding the technical capacity on gender inssues for effective inter-institutional coordination;&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
